Z||000007||Elvira||12-02-2001||06:27 PM||||The EGR tube is from IRM and it is great (of course I have only put about 100 miles on the new motor).  The air induction system is from the Fiero Shop in Canada (RaceTech).  They offer it in red (which is what Chester has on his 86GT), yellow and blue.  It was $305, but REALLY lets the car breathe (an looks GOOD!) <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">.  My car is still a work in progress, but it is coming along!<P>------------------<BR>Elvira<BR>Blue 87GT<BR>Black 86GT 5sp x 2<BR>86SC t-top 58k miles<BR>84 Indy<BR>87 4-seater||||reg||10
